                    "text": "Enables one designated ally character and their summon to immediately take action, and increases their DMG dealt by 16.5%. If the target has a summon, then the DMG Boost effect is further boosted by an additional 27.5%, lasting for 2 turn(s).\nAfter using Skill on The Beatified, recovers 1 Skill Point.\nWhen Sunday uses this ability on characters following the Path of Harmony, cannot trigger the \"immediate action\" effect."
